---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="KickzBrary"
  description="Organize, track, and explore your personal sneaker collection with KickzBrary."
>
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">KickzBrary</p>
    <div class="page-app-icon">
      <img
        src="/icons/kickzbrary.png"
        alt="KickzBrary app icon"
        class="app-icon"
      />
    </div>
    <h1>Your sneaker collection, organized.</h1>
    <p>
      KickzBrary helps sneaker enthusiasts catalog, organize, and explore their
      personal collections in one thoughtfully designed app.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-card">
    <h2>About KickzBrary</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary is a personal sneaker library for collectors who want a simple,
      polished way to keep track of the pairs they own. Build your inventory,
      browse your collection in beautiful gallery views, and keep the details
      that matter to you organized in one place.
    </p>

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Catalog your sneaker collection</li>
      <li>Browse your collection in gallery views</li>
      <li>View collection statistics</li>
      <li>Import and export your collection data</li>
      <li>Privacy-focused design</li>
      <li>A native experience for Apple platforms</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      KickzBrary is designed with privacy in mind. Your sneaker collection is
      your own, and the app does not sell your personal information or use it
      for advertising.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="/privacy/kickzbrary">View KickzBrary Privacy Policy →</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Help and Accessibility</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="/support/kickzbrary">Support</a>
      · <a href="/privacy/kickzbrary">Privacy Policy</a>
      · <a href="/accessibility/kickzbrary">Accessibility</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Follow KickzBrary</h2>
    <p>
      <a
        href="https://www.instagram.com/kickzbrary"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >Follow @kickzbrary on Instagram →</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Status</h2>
    <p>KickzBrary is available now on the App Store.</p>

    <a
      class="app-store-badge"
      href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/kickzbrary/id6761675327?itscg=30200&itsct=apps_box_badge&mttnsubad=6761675327"
      aria-label="Download KickzBrary on the App Store"
    >
      <img
        src="https://toolbox.marketingtools.apple.com/api/v2/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us"
        alt="Download on the App Store"
        width="245"
        height="82"
      />
    </a>

    <p class="apple-legal">
      Apple, the Apple logo, iPhone, and iPad are trademarks of Apple Inc.,
      registered in the U.S. and other countries. App Store is a service mark
      of Apple Inc., registered in the U.S. and other countries.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
